# Coding standards

- Python 3.11+, type hints on public functions, pydantic models for configs.
- Prefer small pure modules; side effects at service/API edges.
- Use `structlog` via `crypto_bot.utils.logging.get_logger`.
- Raise `CryptoBotError` subclasses with `guidance=` for UI/log actionability.
- Ruff + mypy must pass; no bare `except:`.
- Strategies that run under freqtrade may keep freqtrade-style naming (`populate_*`).
- Do not import torch/transformers at module top-level — lazy load FinBERT.
